WEBVTT

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:31.206
macanaha marwalbo waan gargariiraa.

00:00:31.206 --> 00:00:34.053
Fiiri.

00:00:34.053 --> 00:00:37.460
waa mid lagudaalo. Shakiira oo kale ayaan ahay, Shakira

00:00:37.460 --> 00:00:39.240
oo lakulmeysa Muhammad Ali.

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:42.236
(Qosol)

00:00:42.236 --> 00:00:44.231
gargariirku ma ahan fir.

00:00:44.231 --> 00:00:47.015
ma ahan cilad dhalasho. Ma qaban kartid.

00:00:47.015 --> 00:00:50.435
qofna inkaar ma dhigin ilma-galeenka hooyadey,

00:00:50.435 --> 00:00:53.671
maha helin maxa yelay waalidkeeyga waa llma-adeeradii ugu horeeyay

00:00:53.671 --> 00:00:55.172
taas oo ayba yihiin.

00:00:55.172 --> 00:00:59.241
(Qosol)

00:00:59.241 --> 00:01:01.595
Shilal ayee uun ka imaadaan,